# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

buffers is project
buffers purpose "Build text in a byte buffer, parse numbers, and classify bytes; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
buffers target console
buffers version "0.1.0"
buffers language refined 1
buffers standardLibrary 1
buffers allows write console.stdout none
buffers requires none
buffers includesModule buffers
buffers entry buffers.main
